CowSwapModuleFactory_FactoryOperators
├── given no operator has been approved
│   └── it should report false for any address, including the owner
├── when caller is neither the owner nor an approved operator (fuzzed)
│   └── it should revert with CowSwapModuleFactory_NotOwnerOrOperator on create and createDeterministic
├── when caller is not the owner
│   ├── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount for a stranger
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount for an approved operator
└── when caller is the owner
    ├── when operator is the zero address
    │   └── it should revert with CowSwapModuleFactory_ZeroOperator
    ├── when approving an operator
    │   ├── it should set factoryOperators to true
    │   ├── it should emit FactoryOperatorSet(owner, operator, true)
    │   └── it should return true
    ├── when revoking an operator
    │   ├── it should set factoryOperators to false
    │   └── it should emit FactoryOperatorSet(owner, operator, false)
    └── when the value is unchanged
        ├── it should not revert
        └── it should emit FactoryOperatorSet again
